cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Soybean T2T genome assembly and annotation pipeline"
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite the associated manuscript and this repository."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sibs-zz/soybean_assembly_annotation"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline for telomere-to-telomere (T2T) assembly of soybean
  (Glycine max) genomes from HiFi, ultra-long ONT and Hi-C reads, followed by
  evidence-based gene annotation, high-confidence filtering and ZH13-style
  locus renaming.
keywords:
  - soybean
  - Glycine max
  - T2T
  - genome assembly
  - gene annotation
  - HiFi
  - ONT
  - Hi-C
